    whenToCall: [
      'Your Level 2 charging station refuses to power on or displays an orange/red fault light',
      'The circuit breaker trips repeatedly after 15 to 45 minutes of vehicle charging',
      'The charging plug or wall outlet feels uncomfortably hot or shows scorched plastic',
      'Your vehicle displays "Charging Interrupted" or fails to lock onto the connector'
